:: Noah Hang Out Park Playground Swings [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, oh! Can you push me on the swings!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> bounces up and down, grabbing your arm and yanking you over to the swing set before suddenly stopping in his tracks, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, umm… I mean, can you pretty please push me on the swings since you’re the best brother ever?”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He turns around, putting on his best puppy-dog face, excitedly hoping you agree.</span> You roll your eyes and chuckle, nodding. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yay!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> <span style="color:Pink">jumps, continuing to pull you over to the swing set where he practically leaps onto it.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I was swinging at school the other day and I went SUPER high! Like, I don’t think anyone could go higher than me!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> begins to ramble on as he kicks himself up with his feet, really not even needing your help. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“See, look at my feet! I just KICK like that, right when I’m going back so I gain height and stuff. Then I SWING my legs like this! See, are you watching?”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You laugh, finding <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s over explanation of his swinging technique adorable.</span> <br>
<br>
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> if he actually wants you to push him, or if he just wants to show off. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> blushes and laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I want you to push me, dummy! I’m just showing you how good I am! I think if you push me hard and I do this; I can go SUPER high! Maybe even get over the top bar!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> seems pretty excited at the prospect of gaining a lot of height, though he may get a little scared if you push him too hard. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Give him some gentle pushes<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        Not wanting to scare the boy by giving him too much height, or maybe just wanting a more relaxing swing session, you give him gentle yet firm pushes on the back, letting <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> gain most of his height himself. <span style="color:LightGreen">Even without your help, the boy gains some height, nearly passing above your shoulders as he huffs and puffs from the strength of his kicks.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on! Push me harder!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> complains, leaning back to stick his tongue out at you when he suddenly loses his balance and almost tumbles out of the swing, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“W- woah!”</span> You manage to catch him just in time, <span style="color:Pink">his $NoahBottoms.Type slipping up just enough to show his underwear-clad butt, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> to quickly blush.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Aaahh! Don’t look!”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Noah",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 2,
                        PantsDown: 1,
