        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <span style="color:red">-Noah Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 5>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Noah Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Push him hard<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        With a smirk and a desire to give <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> exactly what he is asking for, <span style="color:LightGreen">you push him hard! Not hard enough to knock him off or anything, but enough to give him some serious height!</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Woah! H- hold on a second! Let me catch my-”</span> You push him again, causing him to go even higher, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Haha, wait! This might be a little-”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Another push and you laugh as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> squeezes the chains of the swing tightly, a nervous smile on his face. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Too high! Too high!”</span> He laughs, excitement and fear mixing together in an adrenaline cocktail.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Noah",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Eyes: "Sad",
                        Blush: 1,
