	<<requiresTrait "Bully" "Give the dork a wedgie">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">With a devious smirk and eyes locked on the back of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s fluttering shirt, the waistband of his $NoahUndies.Name poking out perfectly, you give him some nice gentle pushes to give him a false sense of security.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on! Higher! Higher!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> giggles, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You can do better than that!”</span> Oh, you can, but you don’t plan to. Instead, you wait until <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> is at the peak of his swing, about to plummet back down due to gravity, <span style="color:Pink">and suddenly grip the back of his underwear!</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ooft!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> <span style="color:Pink">grunts, his underwear instantly pulled taunt! It stretches about a foot, squeezing his balls as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> releases the chains and grips at his groin.</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">This, combined with your hold and the swing’s forward momentum, sends him slamming backwards and landing on his butt in the sand with a thud! You release his underwear, causing the stretched fabric to snap back towards his shoulders, as the boy begins to whine.</span> <br>

