        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Owwww…”</span> He says with a pained voice, looking up at you with a scowl and watery eyes. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That hurt you jerk!”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">He yells, picking up a bunch of sand and tossing a glob of it at you.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That was mean – ow!”</span> He says as he sits up, gripping his slightly bruised shoulder in pain from the fall. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You’re such a meanie!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> begins to pout, getting to his feet and stomping away. You call after him, saying it was just a joke, <span style="color:Pink">but can’t help but laugh as you spot his stretched underwear dangling from his backside like some embarrassing flag.</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">This just makes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> more upset as he hides behind the slide for a while pouting until you are finally able to convince him to come back out.</span> <br>
